--- B3 侧边聊天 HTML 结构
"<section class=\"td-mod td-side\" id=\"av-browse-pane-side\" data-td-pane=\"side\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-label=\"侧边聊天\">\n      <div class=\"td-mod-bar\">\n        <span class=\"td-side-tag\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H8l-4 3V6a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h12a2 2 0 0 1 2 2Z\"></path><path d=\"M9 9h6\"></path><path d=\"M9 13h4\"></path></svg>侧边聊天</span>\n        <span class=\"td-side-hint\">不打断主对话</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"td-side-body\" data-td-side-body=\"1\">\n        <div class=\"td-side-quote\" data-td-side-quote=\"1\" hidden=\"\">在 main 里选中一段文字 → 点浮条上的「在侧边聊天中提问」，这里会引用原文。</div>\n        <div class=\"td-side-msg is-user\"><div class=\"td-side-bub\">这段折叠逻辑为什么要等 rAF 再翻属性？</div></div>\n        <div class=\"td-side-msg is-ai\"><span class=\"td-side-av\">A</span><div class=\"td-side-bub\">因为折叠动画依赖元素当前高度：同一帧内先改内容再读高度会拿到旧值。等一帧（rAF）后属性已落盘，再翻 <code>data-r93-open</code>，动画起点才和展开方向对称。</div></div>\n        <div class=\"td-side-msg is-ai\"><span class=\"td-side-av\">A</span><div class=\"td-side-bub\">顺带提一句：这里只改了视觉，未落盘的数据结构没有动。</div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"td-side-in\">\n        <textarea class=\"td-side-ta\" rows=\"1\" aria-label=\"向侧边聊天提问\" placeholder=\"就选中内容提问…\"></textarea>\n        <button class=\"td-side-send\" type=\"button\" data-td-side-send=\"1\" aria-label=\"发送\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19V5\"></path><path d=\"m5 12 7-7 7 7\"></path></svg></button>\n      </div>\n    </section>"
